# Stack

- .NET SDK pinned in `global.json` (`10.0.101`, roll-forward `latestMajor`)
- App: .NET MAUI 10 — `net10.0-android` / `net10.0-ios` (`Principles/Principles.csproj`)
- Core: `net10.0` class library (`Principles.Core/Principles.Core.csproj`)
- CommunityToolkit.Maui / Mvvm, DIPS.Mobile.UI, DevExpress.Maui, Serilog
- Local notifications: `Plugin.LocalNotification` (app project only)
- Ads: `Plugin.AdMob`; charts: LiveCharts / SkiaSharp
- Backend: separate .NET WebAPI repo (see `run-backend-and-frontend.ps1`)
- Prefer `dotnet build` with `-p:TargetFramework=net10.0-android` for fast verify; full multi-target when shipping
